! Welcome to Legal Wiki

Legal Wiki is a TiddlyWiki-based system designed for legal professionals to manage cases, organize research, and maintain document templates.

!! Key Features

* ''Case Management'' - Track cases with clients, deadlines, and status updates
* ''Legal Research'' - Organize citations, statutes, and case law references
* ''Document Templates'' - Maintain reusable templates for common legal documents
* ''Timeline Tracking'' - Monitor important dates and deadlines
* ''Client Records'' - Securely store client information and communications

!! Getting Started

# Review the [[Getting Started]] guide
# Explore the [[Case Dashboard]] to see how cases are organized
# Check out the [[Templates]] section for document templates
# Create your first case using the [[New Case Template]]

!! Navigation

Use the sidebar on the right to:

* Search for tiddlers
* View recent changes
* Access tools and settings
* Browse by tags

!! Tips

* Use tags like `Case`, `Client`, `Research`, `Template` to organize your content
* Link related tiddlers together using `[[Double Brackets]]`
* Use the table of contents macro for long documents
* Save frequently using the {{$:/core/ui/Buttons/save-wiki}} button
